<a name="CommAnchor773250"></a>
    <details class="CommentBox" open>
      <summary><h3 class="CommentTitle">event-stream, npm, and trust</h3>
      <div class="AnnLine">
      <p class="CommentPoster"> Posted Nov 29, 2018 9:57 UTC (Thu)
                               by <b>mjthayer</b> (guest, #39183)
                              [<a href="/Articles/773250/">Link</a>] (12 responses)
      </p>
      
      </div>
